flowchart TD
    A([Model response]) --> B{Provider-native calls present?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Validate exact catalog name and schema]
    B -->|No| D[Run pure fixed-order text parsers]
    D --> E[Declared profile]
    D --> F[Hermes and Liquid]
    D --> G[Continue tool codeblock]
    D --> H[goose tokenized markers]
    D --> I[Fenced and bare JSON]
    D --> J[Bounded suffix repair]
    E --> K{One unambiguous interpretation?}
    F --> K
    G --> K
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K -->|No or rejected| L[Typed correction without raw content]
    K -->|Yes| C
    C --> M{Identity schema and limits valid?}
    M -->|No| L
    M -->|Yes| N[Common approval journal and dispatch pipeline]
    N --> O([Tool execution result])
